::  name       receipt offer bounds count
::  shape      ceilings - int (@u32)
::  invariant  tally/receipt_offer_bounds.rye publishes exactly twelve typed ceilings
::  example    12
::  readers    Tally - Mantra - Glow Tend - shape museum
::  nib        tally-tend-7-v0
::
::  Pheromone -- Tally Glow Tend limb 7. Names how many typed ceilings the first
::  readable receipt offer publishes in tally/receipt_offer_bounds.rye: identifier,
::  purpose, value-basis, encoded-fact, amount, replay, card width and height,
::  product digest length, value unit, return kind, and signature. The count is
::  the number the witness reads from the rye rather than copies here.
::  Pedestal only; Rye still owns every ceiling's value, the BoundError set, and
::  each admission check. Twelve sits well under rune_shape.max_fields (15), so
::  this pedestal does not raise it.
+$  receipt-offer-bounds-shape
  $:  ceilings=@u32
  ==
